"╭ Saltbox settings ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮"
"│ Search   press / to search                                                   │"
"╰─╭ Keys: fact editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮╯"
"› │ Move                                    Save                              │ "
"  │  ↑ ↓ k j            a row                s Ctrl+S   save the changes      │ "
"  │  PgUp PgDn b Space  a page                                                │ "
"  │  Home End g G       first, last         In a box                          │ "
"  │  ← → h l            fold, open           Enter      keep                  │ "
"  │                                          Alt+Enter  a new line            │ "
"  │ Find                                     Esc        cancel                │ "
"  │  /                  search the names     Tab        leave the search box  │ "
"  │                                                                           │ "
"  │ Change                                  Leave                             │ "
"  │  Enter              edit, or fold        Esc        clear search, or quit │ "
"  │  e                  edit the value       q          quit, asks to save    │ "
"  │  a                  add a setting        Ctrl+C     stop (exit 130)       │ "
"  │  c                  copy the value       ? F1       these keys            │ "
"  │  d                  delete, or keep                                       │ "
"  │  u                  undo the change                                       │ "
"╭ │  m Menu             the row's menu                                        │╮"
"│ │                                                                           ││"
"╰─│ Mouse: a click selects, the wheel scrolls, a right click opens the menu   │╯"
"  ╰ any key closes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯ "
"  Edit (e)   Add (a)   Delete (d)   Save (s)   Keys (?)   Quit (q)              "
